cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this toolkit, cite this software release.
title: "Geodetic & Elevation Data Toolkit"
type: software
version: "5.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Koa"
    given-names: "Islam"
    affiliation: "Institut des Géosciences de l’Environnement (IGE), INRAE, Université Grenoble Alpes; An-Najah National University"
abstract: >-
  Local browser-based geodetic and elevation-data toolkit for geoid and
  quasigeoid grid extraction, ellipsoidal and physical height transformations,
  point and CSV calculations, GPS/UTC/Unix time conversion, raster previews, and optional Copernicus DEM,
  SRTM and IGN LiDAR HD acquisition.
keywords:
  - geodesy
  - geoid
  - elevation
  - GPS time
  - GNSS
  - vertical datum
  - RAF20
  - EGM96
  - EGM2008
  - DEM
license: CeCILL-B
